## 📝 **Advanced Pronoun Practice Questions**

### Q1. सही वाक्य चुनें –

a) It is I who am responsible.
b) It is me who are responsible.
c) It is me who am responsible.
d) It is I who is responsible.

---

### Q2. रिक्त स्थान भरें –

Each of the boys has done \_\_\_\_ homework.
a) their
b) his
c) her
d) its

---

### Q3. सही विकल्प चुनें –

Neither Ramesh nor his friends confessed that \_\_\_\_ were guilty.
a) he
b) she
c) they
d) them

---

### Q4. त्रुटि पहचानें –

Between you and I, this task is very difficult.
a) Between – गलत है
b) you – गलत है
c) I – गलत है
d) कोई त्रुटि नहीं

---

### Q5. सही Relative Pronoun चुनें –

I know the man \_\_\_\_ car was stolen yesterday.
a) who
b) whom
c) which
d) whose

